    "detailed_description": "Enlist in law enforcement or misfortune, take the intensity of combat to a new level and control of the situation in your hands, with the magnificent shooting simulator with 85% realism &quot;Eighteen Gold&quot;. Choose your weapon, prove your worth on the field, rise and compete to enter elite forces where only the best survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEighteen Gold is an action shooter game based on multiplayer mode.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the new era of video game shooters with Eighteen Gold debuting ATEG's new shooter mode dubbed &quot;Operational&quot; and mixed with a simplified GTA style.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIncludes: (Eighteen Gold Special Edition)<br />\r\nBase Content and 3 DLC Content<br />\r\nVariety of Modes and some Zombies Mode.<br />\r\nGood arsenal<br />\r\nVariety of characters<br />\r\nCustom weapons<br />\r\nNew Enhancements<br />\r\nFuture content<br />\r\n2 Apps:<br />\r\nEighteen Gold Special Edition<br />\r\nEighteen Gold 2",
