    "short_description": "Enlist in law enforcement or misfortune, take the intensity of combat to a new level and control of the situation in your hands, with the magnificent shooting simulator with 85% realism, Eighteen Gold... (Now with Eighteen Gold SE + Eighteen Gold 2)",
